/* Barrett Reduction, computes a (mod b) with a precomputed value c
 *
 * Assumes that 0 < x <= m*m, note if 0 > x > -(m*m) then you can merely
 * compute the reduction as -1 * mp_reduce(mp_abs(x)) [pseudo code].
 */
